10215 01FA 24 04              BCC     FILNX2    JUMP IF SO
10216 01FC 7E 0138            JMP     ERRM      ERROR -> PRINT '?' AND RETURN TO EXEC PROMPT
10217 01FF 39         FILEEX  RTS     
