10232 0219 39                 RTS     
10233                                           *
10234                                           *THIS ROUTINE PERFORMS BINARY TO HEX CONVERSION,
10235                                           *AND PRINTS THE RESULT USING THE SWITCHED PRINT 
10236                                           *VECTOR TO SELECT THE OUTPUT DEVICE.
10237                                           *
10238 021A 97 5D      PRBIN   STAA    CH        COPY THE BINARY DATA   
10239 021C 44                 LSRA              SHIFT THE 4
10240 021D 44                 LSRA              MOST SIGNIFICANT
10241 021E 44                 LSRA              BITS INTO A
10242 021F 44                 LSRA              BINARY VALUE
10243 0220 BD 022A            JSR     PRBN1     PRINT THE VALUE(H)
10244 0223 96 5D              LDAA    CH        GET THE BINARY DATA
10245 0225 84 0F              ANDA    #$0F      STRIP OFF THE HIGH DIGIT
10246 0227 7E 022A            JMP     PRBN1     PRINT THE VALUE(L) & RETURN
10247 
10248 022A 81 0A      PRBN1   CMPA    #$0A      IF .GE. 9
10249 022C 2B 02              BMI     PRBN2     THEN
10250 022E 8B 07              ADDA    #$07      SKIP OVER : TO @
10251 0230 8B 30      PRBN2   ADDA    #$30      CONVERT TO ASCII (HEX)
10252 0232 7E 08AF            JMP     CO        console char out
